<div class="js-gist-file-update-container js-task-list-container">
      <div id="file-yubikey_ssh-md" class="file my-2">
      <div id="file-yubikey_ssh-md-readme" class="Box-body readme blob tmp-p-5 tmp-p-xl-6 gist-border-0"
    style="overflow: auto" tabindex="0" role="region"
    aria-label="yubikey_ssh.md content, created by kellydavid on 04:01PM on July 15, 2022."
  >
    <article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 class="heading-element" dir="auto">Set up Yubikey (5C NFC) for SSH authentication</h1><a id="user-content-set-up-yubikey-5c-nfc-for-ssh-authentication" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Set up Yubikey (5C NFC) for SSH authentication" href="#set-up-yubikey-5c-nfc-for-ssh-authentication"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>yubikey 5C NFC</li>
<li>macOS Monterey 12.2.1</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">For in depth details on how to set up a Yubikey for SSH on a mac, check out the following:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://florin.myip.org/blog/easy-multifactor-authentication-ssh-using-yubikey-neo-tokens" rel="nofollow">https://florin.myip.org/blog/easy-multifactor-authentication-ssh-using-yubikey-neo-tokens</a></li>
<li><a href="https://gist.github.com/ixdy/6fdd1ecea5d17479a6b4dab4fe1c17eb">https://gist.github.com/ixdy/6fdd1ecea5d17479a6b4dab4fe1c17eb</a></li>
</ul>
</article>
