    <article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 class="heading-element" dir="auto">The Witcher 3 5.0 on Proton: re-enable DLSS, DLSS-G and ray tracing</h1><a id="user-content-the-witcher-3-50-on-proton-re-enable-dlss-dlss-g-and-ray-tracing" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: The Witcher 3 5.0 on Proton: re-enable DLSS, DLSS-G and ray tracing" href="#the-witcher-3-50-on-proton-re-enable-dlss-dlss-g-and-ray-tracing"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d71664a5dce0399b989ffb12605dd8a65d74708efbbaf08d8d3626b269b4b777/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f67616d652d352e3031253230254332254237253230352e303063253230254332254237253230352e302d386230303030"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d71664a5dce0399b989ffb12605dd8a65d74708efbbaf08d8d3626b269b4b777/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f67616d652d352e3031253230254332254237253230352e303063253230254332254237253230352e302d386230303030" alt="game 5.01" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/game-5.01%20%C2%B7%205.00c%20%C2%B7%205.0-8b0000" style="max-width: 100%;"></a> <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://camo.githubusercontent."><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent." alt="NVIDIA" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/NVIDIA-DLSS%20%C2%B7%20DLSS--G%20%C2%B7%20RT%20%C2%B7%20PT-76B900?logo=nvidia&amp;logoColor=white" style="max-width: 100%;"></a> <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/7dc17482ad787bf2fb19744e210e767483168b3988b05f31d86e941c41a956b1/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f414d442d5254253230254332254237253230505425323025433225423725323046535225323046472d4544314332343f6c6f676f3d616d64266c6f676f436f6c6f723d7768697465"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/7dc17482ad787bf2fb19744e210e767483168b3988b05f31d86e941c41a956b1/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f414d442d5254253230254332254237253230505425323025433225423725323046535225323046472d4544314332343f6c6f676f3d616d64266c6f676f436f6c6f723d7768697465" alt="AMD" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/AMD-RT%20%C2%B7%20PT%20%C2%B7%20FSR%20FG-ED1C24?logo=amd&amp;logoColor=white" style="max-width: 100%;"></a> <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://camo.githubusercontent."><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent." alt="Proton" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Proton-Wineland%20%C2%B7%20Experimental%20%C2%B7%20GE-1b2838?logo=steam&amp;logoColor=white" style="max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
<p dir="auto">An unofficial workaround until CD PROJEKT RED or Valve fix this properly. As soon as the 5.0 executable sees Wine, it turns off Streamline (DLSS SR/RR, DLSS-G, Reflex), ray tracing, path tracing and FSR frame generation. Everything here brings them back.</p>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-important" dir="auto"><p class="markdown-alert-title" dir="auto"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-report mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"></path></svg>Important</p><p dir="auto">The exe patch script supports only <code>bin/x64_dx12/witcher3.exe</code> <strong>5.0.0.1048522</strong> (patch 5.01, 2026-10-08, Steam build 25773555, sha256 <code>2df76539…b101</code>), <strong>5.0.0.1044392</strong> (the 2026-10-01 5.00c hotfix, Steam build 25</p>
</div>
</article>
