<div class="js-gist-file-update-container js-task-list-container">
      <div id="file-ksrss-reborn_installation_guide-md" class="file my-2">
      <div id="file-ksrss-reborn_installation_guide-md-readme" class="Box-body readme blob tmp-p-5 tmp-p-xl-6 gist-border-0"
    style="overflow: auto" tabindex="0" role="region"
    aria-label="KSRSS-reborn_Installation_Guide.md content, created by flying-huckleberry on 09:00AM on July 12, 2024."
  >
    <article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 class="heading-element" dir="auto">Kerbin Size Real Solar System (KSRSS) Reborn</h1><a id="user-content-kerbin-size-real-solar-system-ksrss-reborn" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Kerbin Size Real Solar System (KSRSS) Reborn" href="#kerbin-size-real-solar-system-ksrss-reborn"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 class="heading-element" dir="auto">Overview</h2><a id="user-content-overview" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Overview" href="#overview"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">As of the time of writing, KSRSS is the choice mod to provide a realistic Solar System, scaled to the
proportions of the Kerbin system. That means you can reasonably use stock parts to get into orbit and travel around the system.
Additionally, you can easily change the scale of the system between 2 values:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Default</strong>: 1/4 scale replica of the real solar system</li>
<li><strong>Stock</strong>: 1/9 scale replica of the real solar system</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">There are other tweakable configuration settings as well which can be explored on your own.
The other benefit of this mod is that it provides its own career mode.</p>
</article>
